<td id="S5.T2.2.1.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">1.83</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1. Market indicators</span></td>
