<br class="ltx_break">Insight types being analyzed:
{insight}
<br class="ltx_break">{pairwise_questions}
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p4.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p4.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Task:
