<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Variance Analysis and Statistical Significance</h2>

<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Inter-run Variance Analysis</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ D.1 Inter-run Variance Analysis ‣ Appendix D Variance Analysis and Statistical Significance ‣ KAHAN: Knowledge-Augmented Hierarchical Analysis and Narration for Financial Data Narration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> reports variance across 3 experimental runs for each model-method combination. KAHAN demonstrates superior stability with the lowest average variance (1.29) compared to CoT (1.476) and DP (1.746), achieving more consistent performance in 7 out of 9 evaluation dimensions.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T5" class="ltx_table">
