<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Variance analysis across 3 experimental runs. Bold values indicate lowest variance for each comparison. KAHAN achieves lowest variance in 7/9 dimensions and overall.</figcaption>
